# WarriorCast2DebuffsAggressive (21379, level 79, debuffs 4117-8 and 4037-2), every draw 0 and its
# skills never landing: settled (8 AI ticks) and met again after the character stepped away, the
# character is attacked at 200; a clan member (fire_clan, range 300) told of its hit wants both
# debuffs on the attacker at 1000000.
character Hunter 20
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.WarriorBase
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.Warrior
