npc mate 21379 Monster 400 0 0 level 79 skill DEBUFF2 4037 2 skill DEBUFF1 4117 8 clan fire_clan 300

tick x8
away
approach scorpion 300
  desires scorpion attack(player)=200 wander()=5
hit scorpion 10
  desires mate attack(player)=211 cast(player,4037,move)=1000000 cast(player,4117,move)=1000000 wander()=5
